  "recipeCuisine": "Japan",
  "name": "Ponzu Sauce",
  "text": "Ponzu Sauce\n\nPreparation time: 10 minutes, then 24 hours to infuse.\n\nCooking time: None\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\n75-100 ml yuzu juice (substitute 2 lemons or limes),\n\n100 ml soy sauce,\n\n2 tbsp mirin,\n\n3 g kombu Seaweed,\n\n3 g bonito Flakes.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Put the bonito flakes and kombu seaweed into a bottle.\n\n2. Squeeze the citrus fruit and add the measured amount into the bottle.\n\n3. Add the soy sauce and mirin.\n\n4. Shake the bottle and leave in the fridge for 24 hours.",
  "cookTime": "PT0M",
  "recipeYield": "4",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "75-100 ml yuzu juice (substitute 2 lemons or limes),",
    "100 ml soy sauce,",
    "2 tbsp mirin,",
    "3 g kombu Seaweed,",
    "3 g bonito Flakes."
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "1. Put the bonito flakes and kombu seaweed into a bottle."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "2. Squeeze the citrus fruit and add the measured amount into the bottle."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Add the soy sauce and mirin."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Shake the bottle and leave in the fridge for 24 hours."
    }
  ],
  "comment": [
    {
      "@type": "Comment",
      "text": "Preparation time: 10 minutes, then 24 hours to infuse."
    }
